erted city to obtain further leads.\n\nHowever, with the appearance of a mysterious new cultivator, the demonic arm investigation leads Wei Wuxian and Lan Wangji to a plot that threatens the cultivation world as they know it. The gravity of the new situation escalates when the two find it involves the chief cultivator of the renowned Lanling Jin Sect—Jin Guangyao.\n\nAs the pair continue to piece together the crucial conspiracies of the cultivation history, their friends and colleagues grow suspicious of their motives. With the world against him, Wei Wuxian must prove he is not the demonic sorcerer people believe him to be to regain their trust and save the cultivation world from the sinister evil lurking within it.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Cultivation","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Wuxia","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":77,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Magic","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Torture","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Achronological Order","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":24,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Founder of Diabolism: Final Season","english":"The Founder of Diabolism: Final 